# Archon of Cruelty: each part of the trigger does what it can. On turn 3 Bot2 controls only artifacts (no creature or
# planeswalker to sacrifice, and an artifact is not on offer) and has played its whole hand (nothing to discard), yet it
# still loses 3 life and Bot1 still draws a card and gains 3. Bot2's graveyard holds only the Mox Pearl the turn-1 enter
# trigger made it discard, the control that the same trigger does discard when there is a card to discard.

